/**
 * Phone media gateway control plane for the existing CKM Sergey/Cartesia voice.
 * WordPress never handles RTP/audio. A long-lived gateway receives PBX media,
 * sends 8 kHz PCM to Deepgram Nova-3 (ru), asks the existing AI seller for text,
 * then asks the already configured CKM Voice Gateway to synthesize Sergey.
